{"id":"vod_lz_73007","vodId":"73007","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"不死不幸","name_cn":"不死不幸","date":"2023-01-01","year":"2023","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20231007-1/c1652f32a426c441ad77a838184f797c.jpg"},"summary":"　　出云风子在8岁时，因自己的能力“不幸”造成了一场200人死亡的飞机事故，而她的双亲也在事故中丧生，她自此10年闭门不出。2020年8月，在一直追看的长篇少女漫画连载完结后，她决定自杀。此时她遇见拥有“不死”能力的安迪。安迪凭借其强大的再生能力，即使在风子“不幸”能力的影响下仍能生还。阻止风子自杀后，两人出发寻找让安迪死去的方法。　　随后，风子发现世上还有其他人拥有类似的异能。能够否定某事物的人被称为“否定者”，亦有由否定者组成的组织“Union”。“Union”的职责为完成“默示录”所给予的任务，例如去讨伐UMA（未确认生物）等，以规避世界再被添加“规则”，然后导致世界灭亡的下场。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"动作,动画,冒险"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-03-23 09:57:24","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v.cdnlz14.com/20231007/30133_80dc94b9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v.cdnlz14.com/20231014/30391_b74a7c9b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v.cdnlz14.com/20231021/30756_734a20b6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v.cdnlz14.com/20231028/30992_38de5773/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v.cdnlz14.com/20231104/31207_65790eee/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v.cdnlz14.com/20231111/31421_9b0ab70b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v.cdnlz14.com/20231118/31740_f7fbc36c/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v.cdnlz14.com/20231125/31979_1c8c3c50/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v.cdnlz14.com/20231202/32211_6b5ff502/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v.cdnlz14.com/20231209/32498_1fad5978/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v.cdnlz14.com/20231216/32775_1b4e61e0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v.cdnlz14.com/20231223/33021_619e91b5/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v.cdnlz14.com/20240106/33510_e6f5b137/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v.cdnlz14.com/20240113/33701_2615e64f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v.cdnlz14.com/20240120/339